    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995550/extras/d9c7b6c41199b3b2f5a06a6857ace60d.webp?t=1681074934\" /></div><br><strong>In the sacred lands of Athens, Something has been changed <br>and somehow you can feel the tension.<br>The power of darkness is rising. <br>You must survive against the mightiest gods in history.<br>You have to be ready for everything in this adventure where <br>you will not have any time to catch your breath.<br>But you never know what fate will bring you.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995550/extras/d9c7b6c41199b3b2f5a06a6857ace60d.webp?t=1681074934\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995550/extras/169fcc3fdfc174f9029f041aa67b91ef.poster.avif?t=1681074934\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995550/extras/169fcc3fdfc174f9029f041aa67b91ef.webm?t=1681074934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995550/extras/169fcc3fdfc174f9029f041aa67b91ef.mp4?t=1681074934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995550/extras/fecfd9c846bf0849c92c177da1b54fa4.avif?t=1681074934\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Uncover the secret of paranormal events in your life.<br></li><li> Regain your true identity and avoid enemy obstacles.<br></li><li> Everything you know is a lie. Just trust your instincts.<br></li><li> Remember your past and become stronger.<br></li><li> Crawl, run, hide... But survive.<br></li><li> In this world you either kill or die.<br></li><li> Find the sacred weapons and learn antique skills.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995550/extras/887f0e3d13da720b67ea233b6069427b.avif?t=1681074934\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Reborn : Fate Of Gods is a first person psychological horror game.<br></li><li> With high quality graphics and sound design you can face the true <br>horror experience for the first time.<br></li><li> Mix of stealth and Souls like gameplay.<br></li><li> Different story flow with becoming hunt to be hunter.<br><br> Developed with the feedback of our valuable community.</li></ul>",
